<h1>Welcome</h1>
<p>The Utah Valley Morality Club exists to gather neighbors of good will
who believe that character is built, not born &mdash; over a shared
table, in frank conversation, and in the quiet discipline of reading
well. Here between the mountains and the lake, we gather once each
season &mdash; for supper, for talk, and once a year, over open flame
and good company at the grill.</p>

<p>Membership is open to any person of steady habits and an honest mind who
is willing to be corrected by their neighbors and, in turn, to correct them
gently in return.</p>
